# ================================================================
# WEEKEND QUEST - EMAIL TRANSPORTER CONFIGURATION
# ================================================================
# To send actual emails that arrive in real Gmail, Outlook, or
# university (e.g. xyz@vitstudent.ac.in) inboxes, choose one of the
# options below:

# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 1: GMAIL APP PASSWORD (Recommended & Free)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Go to your Google Account: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#    (Requires 2-Step Verification enabled on your Google account)
# 2. Enter an app name (e.g. "Weekend Quest") and click "Create"
# 3. Google gives you a 16-character code (e.g. "abcd efgh ijkl mnop")
# 4. Paste your Gmail address and that 16-character password below:

SMTP_USER=
SMTP_PASS=

# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 2: RESEND API (https://resend.com)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Free 3,000 emails/month. Paste your API key here:
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_123456789

# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 3: CUSTOM SMTP (SendGrid / Brevo / Mailgun)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# SMTP_HOST=smtp-relay.brevo.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=your_smtp_login
# SMTP_PASS=your_smtp_password
